{"version":1,"key":"card:236","content":{"id":236,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"91023db2-3879-4077-a30b-eeb5776d2601","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 ES3 或者更早以前，是不能在块级作用域中定义函数的，但是所有的浏览器都支持这一行为，于是在 ES5 中，为了修复这不兼容的行为，规定在严格模式下载块级作用域中声明函数将会导致错误"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"ac8d1ed3-1ea0-4566-8834-8f8d99a22448","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"563c350e-7eed-4e79-9201-1af47e5d238e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"\"use strict\";\n\nif (condition) {\n  // 在 ES5 中会导致错误\n  function doSomething() {\n    // empty\n  }\n}","collabId":"8801ae02-1eab-4998-93dd-dc25d9f0bc4f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7508c4c5-95f8-4c30-ab1c-d6b7cc31801d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是上面的行为在 ES6 中却是可以的，在 ES6 的严格模式下，函数的作用域只在块级作用域中，在块级作用域以外不能访问该函数"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"0fe7ddaa-65ac-418b-bc5a-63e3750a4e89","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e4f6be8d-e6af-48fe-955f-9b775c502770","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"\"use strict\";\n\nconsole.log(typeof doSomething); // undefined\n\nif (true) {\n  console.log(typeof doSomething); // function\n  function doSomething() {\n    // empty\n  }\n\n  console.log(typeof doSomething); // function\n}\n\nconsole.log(typeof doSomething); // undefiend","collabId":"2ed5587b-5086-4875-87fc-0151e4f8a63f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cdc410c7-6dae-4ed7-9310-7cb39a867524","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为对于函数的声明会被提升到作用域的最前方，所以第二个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"typeof doSomething"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的结果是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"function"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"570bc9cc-28b3-47fe-ae3e-8bce0108fccd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的行为都是在严格模式下发生的，那么在非严格模式下，函数的声明没有块级作用域的概念，所以函数的声明是在全局作用域中，即在块级作用域之外也可以访问到函数。"}]}],"tags":["JavaScript"],"createTime":1690902449202,"updateTime":1744173495971,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1744173495971}}